OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people have it tough, says
OL,4,Acharity boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity boss has said young people
OL,7,F"have it tough" and were "not
OL,8,Fsnowflakes" as she agreed with comments
OL,9,Ffrom the head of a national review
OL,10,Fabout their mental health.
OL,12,FSheila Griffiths, CEO of Hope 4 More in
OL,13,FCrewe, Cheshire, said many children
OL,14,Fwere struggling because of factors like
OL,15,Fthe education system, social media and
OL,16,Fthe impact of the pandemic.
OL,18,FIt came after Prof Peter Fonagy, who
OL,19,Fhas led an independent review into
OL,20,Fmental health, ADHD and autism, said
OL,21,Fthere had been a rise in mental
OL,22,Fdistress among the younger generation.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
