OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people have it tough, says
OL,4,Acharity boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FGriffiths, whose charity supports young
OL,7,Fpeople with issues around mental
OL,8,Fillness, praised his comments, which
OL,9,Fshe said reflected the "reality" many
OL,10,Fof them faced.
